          "text": "```java\n@Test\npublic void testHWRuleEx1() {\n    // Consecutive H/W characters must not suppress the following consonant\n    // when it does not share the preceding letter's Soundex code.\n    final Soundex soundex = new Soundex();\n\n    assertEquals(\"A100\", soundex.soundex(\"AHWB\"));\n    assertEquals(\"A100\", soundex.soundex(\"AWHB\"));\n    assertEquals(\"A100\", soundex.soundex(\"AHHB\"));\n    assertEquals(\"A100\", soundex.soundex(\"AWWB\"));\n}\n```"
        }
